  "details": "This was a bug reported previously during the open beta but it is now on Live. The previous bug report was marked as completed but the bug is still present in at least two maps. Several features and bug fixes to these worlds were removed due to the regression.\n\nThe major issue with this bug is the regression has affected maps that cannot be re-uploaded due to projects no longer being available, but are actively still being used.\n\nAttached is an image from June 16th, 2024 showing the updated entrance to an affected world. The following picture is the current map, taken today, August 15th, 2025, showing an extremely outdated version of the entrance.\n\nThe aforementioned world is a private one for usage by a closed group (The owner has requested the link not be publicly disclosed)\n\nAnother affected world is this:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_b174b106-5e6e-4f94-a6b6-eda6d17dfdb1/info\n\nThe description notes the addition of a spawn area, however the current one that loads does not have said spawn area, as well as visual errors in some of the meshes that were corrected in later versions.\n\nThis is also still present on the Open Beta",
